{"seq":1,"slug":"graph-traversal-retrieval","title":"图遍历检索","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-rag-knowledge/retrieval/graph-traversal-retrieval","wordCount":1612,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"图遍历检索\">图遍历检索</h1><p>图建好了、社区也摘要好了，现在一个具体问题进来：「张三主导的那笔收购，对赌条款是什么？」这类问题围绕几个明确的实体打转，不需要全局概览，需要的是「从张三这个节点出发，把它周围相关的那一小块子图取出来」。这就是<strong>局部检索（local search）</strong>，也是图谱 RAG 最纯粹、最能体现「沿边走」的检索形态。这一篇讲它的全部机制：怎么找入口、怎么扩展邻域、怎么打分排序、怎么剪枝控量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>局部检索（local search）服务「围绕具体实体」的问题，概念骨架如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>四步骨架</strong>：入口定位（查询实体 → 实体名向量匹配到种子节点）→ 邻域扩展（从种子走 1–2 跳）→ 候选打分 → 剪枝组装。</li>\n<li><strong>跳数是双刃剑</strong>：子图规模随跳数近似指数膨胀（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≈</mo><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></msubsup><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>i</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|N_h| \\approx \\sum_{i=0}^{h} \\bar{d}^{\\,i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2887em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.989em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8247em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），平均度 10 时 3 跳就近千节点，几乎必爆 context，所以通常只走 1–2 跳。</li>\n<li><strong>候选打分三信号</strong>：语义相似度、边权（抽取时打的 strength）、跳距，按系数加权排序。</li>\n<li><strong>个性化 PageRank（PPR）</strong>：从种子撒概率、沿边扩散，一次扩散隐式覆盖多跳并自动给枢纽节点更高分，是 HippoRAG 的内核。</li>\n<li><strong>上下文形态</strong>：「先结构、后原文」的子图叙述，而非扁平 top-k 块——这是图谱让推理更准的物理原因。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[&quot;查询&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;入口定位 · 种子节点&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;邻域扩展 1-2 跳&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; D[&quot;候选打分 · 相似+边权+跳距&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; E[&quot;剪枝 · token 预算&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;子图叙述上下文&quot;]\">graph TD\n  A[\"查询\"] --&gt; B[\"入口定位 · 种子节点\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"邻域扩展 1-2 跳\"]\n  C --&gt; D[\"候选打分 · 相似+边权+跳距\"]\n  D --&gt; E[\"剪枝 · token 预算\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"子图叙述上下文\"]</pre><h2 id=\"局部检索的四步骨架\">局部检索的四步骨架</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Q[查询] --&gt; EX[抽取查询中的实体&lt;br/&gt;张三 / 收购]&#10;  EX --&gt; ENT[入口定位&lt;br/&gt;实体名向量匹配→种子节点]&#10;  ENT --&gt; EXP[邻域扩展&lt;br/&gt;1-2 跳遍历种子邻居]&#10;  EXP --&gt; SCORE[候选打分&lt;br/&gt;边权 + 距离 + 相似度]&#10;  SCORE --&gt; PRUNE[剪枝 + 预算控制&lt;br/&gt;按 token 上限截断]&#10;  PRUNE --&gt; CTX[组装上下文&lt;br/&gt;实体描述+关系+原文片段]&#10;  CTX --&gt; GEN[喂给 LLM 生成]\">flowchart TD\n  Q[查询] --&gt; EX[抽取查询中的实体&lt;br/&gt;张三 / 收购]\n  EX --&gt; ENT[入口定位&lt;br/&gt;实体名向量匹配→种子节点]\n  ENT --&gt; EXP[邻域扩展&lt;br/&gt;1-2 跳遍历种子邻居]\n  EXP --&gt; SCORE[候选打分&lt;br/&gt;边权 + 距离 + 相似度]\n  SCORE --&gt; PRUNE[剪枝 + 预算控制&lt;br/&gt;按 token 上限截断]\n  PRUNE --&gt; CTX[组装上下文&lt;br/&gt;实体描述+关系+原文片段]\n  CTX --&gt; GEN[喂给 LLM 生成]</pre><p>第一步<strong>入口定位</strong>：把查询里的实体抽出来（一次轻量 LLM 调用或 NER），用实体名的向量索引匹配到图里的种子节点——这一步把自然语言问题「锚」到图上。第二步<strong>邻域扩展</strong>：从种子出发遍历 1–2 跳，收集邻居节点和连接它们的边。第三步<strong>候选打分</strong>：给收集到的实体、关系、关联原文片段排序。第四步<strong>剪枝 + 预算控制</strong>：按 token 预算截断，组装成最终上下文。</p>\n<h2 id=\"邻域扩展-跳数是把双刃剑\">邻域扩展：跳数是把双刃剑</h2><p>扩展几跳，是局部检索最关键的旋钮。跳数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 决定召回的子图半径，而子图规模随跳数近似指数膨胀：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>N</mi><mi>h</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≈</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mi>h</mi></munderover><msup><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mrow><mtext> </mtext><mi>i</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|N_h| \\approx \\sum_{i=0}^{h} \\bar{d}^{\\,i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8747em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mspace mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1952em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>d</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{d}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8312em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.0833em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是平均度。一张平均度为 10 的图，1 跳约 10 个邻居、2 跳约 100、3 跳约 1000——<strong>3 跳几乎一定会爆 context</strong>。所以局部检索通常只走 1–2 跳，更深的关联交给专门的多跳方法（见下文 PPR 和 <a href=\"multi-hop-reasoning\">多跳推理</a>）。这里还有 <a href=\"../construction/graph-construction\">图谱构建</a> 里提到的<strong>超级节点</strong>陷阱：若种子的某个邻居是「公司」这种连了上千条边的泛实体，一跳就能炸掉预算，必须对高度节点降权或跳过。</p>\n<h2 id=\"候选打分-把什么排在前面\">候选打分：把什么排在前面</h2><p>收集到的候选可能有几十上百个实体和关系，context 塞不下，必须排序取前若干。一个实用的打分函数综合三个信号：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>score</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>edge</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mtext>dist</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{score}(c) = \\alpha \\cdot \\text{sim}(q, c) + \\beta \\cdot w_{\\text{edge}}(c) - \\gamma \\cdot \\text{dist}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">score</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">edge</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dist</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>sim</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{sim}(q,c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">sim</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：候选与查询的语义相似度（向量），保证主题相关。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>w</mi><mtext>edge</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w_{\\text{edge}}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0269em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">edge</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：候选所在边的权重——还记得 <a href=\"../construction/entity-extraction\">实体与关系抽取</a> 里抽取时给每条关系打的 strength 吗？它在这里兑现价值。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>dist</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{dist}(c)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dist</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：候选到种子的跳数距离，越远越降权。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三个系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha,\\beta,\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 按业务调。这个打分把「语义像、关系强、离得近」的候选顶到前面，是 local search 质量的核心。</p>\n<h2 id=\"个性化-pagerank-一次扩散抵多跳\">个性化 PageRank：一次扩散抵多跳</h2><p>纯 BFS 邻域扩展有个硬伤：它对所有邻居一视同仁，分不清「关键枢纽」和「边缘节点」。<strong>个性化 PageRank（Personalized PageRank, PPR）</strong> 是更聪明的替代——从种子节点撒下初始概率，让概率沿边随机游走扩散，稳态分布就给出了每个节点「相对于这些种子有多重要」的得分：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>α</mi><mtext> </mtext><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>M</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{r} = \\alpha \\, \\vec{s} + (1-\\alpha)\\, M \\vec{r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7973em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>s</mi><mo>⃗</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\vec{s}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.714em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1799em;\"><span class=\"overlay\" style=\"height:0.714em;width:0.471em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.471em\" height=\"0.714em\" style=\"width:0.471em\" viewBox=\"0 0 471 714\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin\"><path d=\"M377 20c0-5.333 1.833-10 5.5-14S391 0 397 0c4.667 0 8.667 1.667 12 5\n3.333 2.667 6.667 9 10 19 6.667 24.667 20.333 43.667 41 57 7.333 4.667 11\n10.667 11 18 0 6-1 10-3 12s-6.667 5-14 9c-28.667 14.667-53.667 35.667-75 63\n-1.333 1.333-3.167 3.5-5.5 6.5s-4 4.833-5 5.5c-1 .667-2.5 1.333-4.5 2s-4.333 1\n-7 1c-4.667 0-9.167-1.833-13.5-5.5S337 184 337 178c0-12.667 15.667-32.333 47-59\nH213l-171-1c-8.667-6-13-12.333-13-19 0-4.667 4.333-11.333 13-20h359\nc-16-25.333-24-45-24-59z\"/></svg></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是种子的初始概率向量（个性化的来源）、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 是转移矩阵、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 是重启概率。PPR 的妙处是<strong>一次扩散就隐式覆盖了多跳邻域</strong>，且自动给高连通的关键节点更高分。这正是 <strong>HippoRAG</strong> 的核心思想——它把「多跳检索」压缩成「一次 PPR」，号称以 10–30 倍更低成本达到社区方案级别的多跳准确率（见 <a href=\"../foundations/graph-rag-patterns\">模式谱系</a>）。PPR 既属于本篇的局部检索（带种子的扩展），又是 <a href=\"multi-hop-reasoning\">多跳推理</a> 的桥梁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"上下文组装-图检索的产物长什么样\">上下文组装：图检索的产物长什么样</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组装内容</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>种子及邻居实体描述</td>\n<td>节点的聚合描述</td>\n<td>告诉 LLM「这些是谁」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关系三元组 + 描述</td>\n<td>边</td>\n<td>告诉 LLM「它们怎么连」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关联原文片段</td>\n<td>实体回指的源 chunk</td>\n<td>提供可引用的事实出处</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>命中的社区报告</td>\n<td>种子所在社区</td>\n<td>补一层局部背景（可选）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>和向量 RAG 直接把 top-k 文本块拼进 prompt 不同，图检索组装的是<strong>结构化的子图叙述</strong>：先讲清有哪些实体、它们的关系网，再附上原文佐证。这种「先结构、后原文」的上下文，正是图谱让 LLM 推理更准的物理原因。怎么和向量召回融合，是 <a href=\"hybrid-graph-vector\">图向量混合</a> 的事；这套上下文好不好，怎么评，见 <a href=\"../practice/graph-rag-evaluation\">评测</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>局部检索（local search）服务「围绕具体实体」的问题，四步：<strong>入口定位 → 邻域扩展 → 候选打分 → 剪枝组装</strong>。</li>\n<li>邻域扩展的跳数是双刃剑：子图规模随跳数指数膨胀，<strong>1–2 跳为限</strong>，更深交给 PPR 或多跳方法；当心超级节点一跳炸预算。</li>\n<li>候选打分综合<strong>语义相似、边权（抽取时的 strength）、跳距</strong>三信号排序，决定 local search 质量。</li>\n<li><strong>个性化 PageRank（PPR）</strong> 用一次概率扩散隐式覆盖多跳并自动加权枢纽节点，是 HippoRAG 的内核。</li>\n<li>图检索组装的是「先结构后原文」的子图叙述，而非扁平的 top-k 块——这是图谱让推理更准的物理原因。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同 hub：边权来自 <a href=\"../construction/entity-extraction\">实体与关系抽取</a>，超级节点治理见 <a href=\"../construction/graph-construction\">图谱构建</a>；PPR 在多跳里的延伸见 <a href=\"multi-hop-reasoning\">多跳推理</a>；与向量融合见 <a href=\"hybrid-graph-vector\">图向量混合</a>。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：相似度检索原理见 <a href=\"../../rag-knowledge-systems/embedding-fundamentals/similarity-search\">RAG 知识系统 · 相似度搜索</a>；图上问答的学术处理见 <a href=\"../../knowledge-graphs/kg-reasoning/kg-question-answering\">知识图谱 · 知识图谱问答</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"图遍历检索","id":"图遍历检索"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"局部检索的四步骨架","id":"局部检索的四步骨架"},{"level":2,"text":"邻域扩展：跳数是把双刃剑","id":"邻域扩展-跳数是把双刃剑"},{"level":2,"text":"候选打分：把什么排在前面","id":"候选打分-把什么排在前面"},{"level":2,"text":"个性化 PageRank：一次扩散抵多跳","id":"个性化-pagerank-一次扩散抵多跳"},{"level":2,"text":"上下文组装：图检索的产物长什么样","id":"上下文组装-图检索的产物长什么样"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"社区检测与摘要","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-rag-knowledge/construction/community-detection"},"next":{"title":"图向量混合","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/graph-rag-knowledge/retrieval/hybrid-graph-vector"}}